  "dct_description_sm": [
    "<p style='margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px;'>To ensure our remaining natural environment continues to provide benefits for future generations, the City must prioritize the protection and enhancement of natural habitat, water and air resources and maintain local biodiversity.  Complementing federal and/or provincial acts and regulations, <a href='https://www.kelowna.ca/our-community/planning-projects/2040-official-community-plan/ch-21-natural-environment-dp-area' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Chapter 21: Natural Environment DPA</a> requires development permits for proposals that may impact the environment, ground and surface water, or other natural conditions. The OCP was adopted by Council on the 10th of January, 2022. Read more about the 2040 OCP on <a href='https://can01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.kelowna.ca%2Four-community%2Fplanning-projects%2F2040-official-community-plan&amp;data=04%7C01%7Ctguidi%40kelowna.ca%7C97485485906e42725aac08d9e1c5a391%7Cc6558401f1cf48cf9607c6e3d3a109f3%7C0%7C0%7C637789061227885297%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C3000&amp;sdata=mMpVtUH3Nz%2F8jIz5mgnnP%2Byd2hlw2SPwsNfr6ov4L8M%3D&amp;reserved=0' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>kelowna.ca.</a></p>"
